 Short Way : not prefer first


                By using filter in main directory
               { grep -rE '^[a-zA-Z0-9]{32}$' .}

               grep → Search karega.
              -r → Sab directories aur sub-directories mein search karega.
              -E → Extended Regex enable karega ({32} use karne ke liye).
               ^ → Line ki shuruaat.
              [a-zA-Z0-9] → Sirf small letters, capital letters aur digits allow hain.
               {32} → Bilkul 32 characters hone chahiye.
                $ → Line yahin khatam honi chahiye.
                . → Current directory se search shuru karo.
